1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,154
Jason thought the driver had betrayed
them. Why else stop the taxi with

2
00:00:05,154 --> 00:00:06,740
their destination still ahead?

3
00:00:06,740 --> 00:00:11,099
An anonymous man waited under the
shelter, holding the envelope their

4
00:00:11,099 --> 00:00:14,270
buyer had refused. Jason reached for his
door.

5
00:00:14,270 --> 00:00:19,025
The driver paused the meter, and pointed
toward Lucia's seat. Her phone

6
00:00:19,025 --> 00:00:20,610
was lying beneath it.

7
00:00:20,610 --> 00:00:25,370
She'd dropped it. The waiting man was a
dispatcher, carrying the envelope

8
00:00:25,370 --> 00:00:27,750
they'd left at the taxi office.

9
00:00:27,750 --> 00:00:32,109
Jason relaxed his hand. He'd been
preparing for somebody to take

10
00:00:32,109 --> 00:00:34,090
something. Nobody had even tried.

11
00:00:34,090 --> 00:00:38,850
Lucia collected her phone. Jason checked
the envelope in front of them.

12
00:00:38,850 --> 00:00:41,230
Their returned advance was still intact.

13
00:00:41,230 --> 00:00:47,172
He paid the fare and added a tip. The
driver smiled and asked if they

14
00:00:47,172 --> 00:00:48,360
wanted their destination.

15
00:00:48,360 --> 00:00:53,453
Home, Lucia said. The meter started
again. Jason watched its numbers climb

16
00:00:53,453 --> 00:00:56,000
and felt relieved to understand why.
